  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>本模组需要安装 Create 或 Sable 才能正常运行</strong></h1>\n<p>本模组新增了乘坐功能，允许在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 的机械装置上乘坐来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[let's do] furniture</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/another-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">another furniture</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">handcrafted</a> 的家具；同时支持 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-aeronautics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create:Aeronautics</a> 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sable</a> 子系统。</p>",
